      "id": "claim_3b09837d4ea04f858a7dbbfc04ce26d6",
      "statement": "PPH v1 exposes exactly three deprecated endpoints — EP-PPH-01 GET /pph/v1/wires/{wireRef}/status, EP-PPH-02 GET /pph/v1/wires?clientId&fromDate&toDate, and EP-PPH-03 POST /pph/v1/wires — all scheduled for sunset 2027-03-31 with no extensions, confirmed by ARB on 2026-09-08 because the v1 adapter is unsupported on the Volaris 9.6 upgrade (April 2027).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/estate/pph-api-cat-2026.3-prism-payments-hub-api-and-event-catalog.md#L24-L43",
