      "id": "claim_536d7b9a6c37406488b8497dcc7879a8",
      "statement": "v1's status value PROCESSED collapses four distinct v2 lifecycle states — RELEASED, SENT_TO_NETWORK, NETWORK_ACCEPTED, and COMPLETED — so v1 consumers cannot distinguish a merely-released wire from one acknowledged by the network or closed in accounting.",
