      "id": "claim_be7fd83046ef4d43be71e0cd01326acb",
      "statement": "EP-PPH-01's 20 TPS shared rate limit was imposed in June 2024 as a direct remediation action from incident INC-2024-1182/PIR-2024-07, in which Wire Status Lite's 30-second auto-refresh polling drove ~85 TPS against this endpoint and exhausted PPH's API thread pool for 47 minutes; CBO Wire Center now enforces a 60-second server-side cache plus a refresh throttle of 1 call per 60 seconds per wire against EP-PPH-01 per ADR-PAY-019.",
